  "changelog": "- Initial release of geoskill-frost-risk-mapping.\n- Provides terrain-corrected frost risk mapping using daily minimum temperature time series and DEM, applying lapse rate, cold-air pooling (TPI), and aspect corrections.\n- Outputs include per-pixel frost risk level, frost-free period, frost frequency (GeoTIFFs), and summary statistics (JSON).\n- Supports fully offline usage and synthetic DEM/minimum temperature generation for validation and demo purposes.\n- Includes detailed instructions, example commands, and clear description in both English and Chinese.\n- Licensed under MIT.",
